    "start": "00:01:39.950",
    "end": "00:01:39.960",
    "start_seconds": 99.95,
    "end_seconds": 99.96000000000001,
    "text": "Roughly speaking, more intrusiveness"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.960",
    "end": "00:01:42.350",
    "start_seconds": 99.96000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 102.35,
    "text": "Roughly speaking, more intrusiveness means more accuracy. So ROMs are more"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.350",
    "end": "00:01:42.360",
    "start_seconds": 102.35,
    "end_seconds": 102.36,
    "text": "means more accuracy. So ROMs are more"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.360",
    "end": "00:01:45.190",
    "start_seconds": 102.36,
    "end_seconds": 105.19,
    "text": "means more accuracy. So ROMs are more accurate than the black box approach. On"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.190",
    "end": "00:01:45.200",
    "start_seconds": 105.19,
    "end_seconds": 105.2,
    "text": "accurate than the black box approach. On"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.200",
    "end": "00:01:47.910",
    "start_seconds": 105.2,
    "end_seconds": 107.91,
    "text": "accurate than the black box approach. On the other hand, more intrusiveness mean"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.910",
    "end": "00:01:47.920",
    "start_seconds": 107.91,
    "end_seconds": 107.92,
    "text": "the other hand, more intrusiveness mean"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:47.920",
    "end": "00:01:51.270",
    "start_seconds": 107.92,
    "end_seconds": 111.27000000000001,
    "text": "the other hand, more intrusiveness mean means less speed up. So the BB method is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.270",
    "end": "00:01:51.280",
    "start_seconds": 111.27000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 111.28,
    "text": "means less speed up. So the BB method is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:51.280",
    "end": "00:01:54.350",
    "start_seconds": 111.28,
    "end_seconds": 114.35,
    "text": "means less speed up. So the BB method is faster than ROMs in general. We are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.350",
    "end": "00:01:54.360",
    "start_seconds": 114.35,
    "end_seconds": 114.36,
    "text": "faster than ROMs in general. We are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:54.360",
    "end": "00:01:56.430",
    "start_seconds": 114.36,
    "end_seconds": 116.43,
    "text": "faster than ROMs in general. We are surrogate model that is NM ROM."
