  {
    "start": "00:02:05.070",
    "end": "00:02:05.080",
    "start_seconds": 125.07,
    "end_seconds": 125.08,
    "text": "full order model, which is not"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.080",
    "end": "00:02:08.749",
    "start_seconds": 125.08,
    "end_seconds": 128.749,
    "text": "full order model, which is not practical. However, we have improved the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.749",
    "end": "00:02:08.759",
    "start_seconds": 128.749,
    "end_seconds": 128.75900000000001,
    "text": "practical. However, we have improved the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:08.759",
    "end": "00:02:11.390",
    "start_seconds": 128.75900000000001,
    "end_seconds": 131.39,
    "text": "practical. However, we have improved the NM ROM speed up tremendously. This is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.390",
    "end": "00:02:11.400",
    "start_seconds": 131.39,
    "end_seconds": 131.4,
    "text": "NM ROM speed up tremendously. This is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.400",
    "end": "00:02:14.350",
    "start_seconds": 131.4,
    "end_seconds": 134.35,
    "text": "NM ROM speed up tremendously. This is our main contribution. To explain what"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.350",
    "end": "00:02:14.360",
    "start_seconds": 134.35,
    "end_seconds": 134.36,
    "text": "our main contribution. To explain what"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:14.360",
    "end": "00:02:17.110",
    "start_seconds": 134.36,
    "end_seconds": 137.11,
    "text": "our main contribution. To explain what NM ROM is, I will compare NM ROM with LS"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.110",
    "end": "00:02:17.120",
    "start_seconds": 137.11,
    "end_seconds": 137.12,
    "text": "NM ROM is, I will compare NM ROM with LS"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:17.120",
    "end": "00:02:19.750",
    "start_seconds": 137.12,
    "end_seconds": 139.75,
    "text": "NM ROM is, I will compare NM ROM with LS ROM step by step. First of all, LS ROM"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.750",
    "end": "00:02:19.760",
    "start_seconds": 139.75,
    "end_seconds": 139.76,
    "text": "ROM step by step. First of all, LS ROM"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:19.760",
    "end": "00:02:21.470",
    "start_seconds": 139.76,
    "end_seconds": 141.47,
    "text": "ROM step by step. First of all, LS ROM uses linear subspace solution"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.470",
    "end": "00:02:21.480",
    "start_seconds": 141.47,
    "end_seconds": 141.48,
    "text": "uses linear subspace solution"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:21.480",
    "end": "00:02:24.070",
    "start_seconds": 141.48,
    "end_seconds": 144.07,
    "text": "uses linear subspace solution representation, while NM ROM uses a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.070",
    "end": "00:02:24.080",
    "start_seconds": 144.07,
    "end_seconds": 144.07999999999998,
    "text": "representation, while NM ROM uses a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:24.080",
    "end": "00:02:26.310",
    "start_seconds": 144.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 146.31,
    "text": "representation, while NM ROM uses a non-linear manifold representation using"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.310",
    "end": "00:02:26.320",
    "start_seconds": 146.31,
    "end_seconds": 146.32,
    "text": "non-linear manifold representation using"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:26.320",
    "end": "00:02:29.950",
    "start_seconds": 146.32,
    "end_seconds": 149.95,
    "text": "non-linear manifold representation using non-linear map G. We use autoencoder to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.950",
    "end": "00:02:29.960",
    "start_seconds": 149.95,
    "end_seconds": 149.96,
    "text": "non-linear map G. We use autoencoder to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:29.960",
    "end": "00:02:32.750",
    "start_seconds": 149.96,
    "end_seconds": 152.75,
    "text": "non-linear map G. We use autoencoder to obtain the non-linear map. Then both LS"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.750",
    "end": "00:02:32.760",
    "start_seconds": 152.75,
    "end_seconds": 152.76,
    "text": "obtain the non-linear map. Then both LS"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:32.760",
    "end": "00:02:35.150",
    "start_seconds": 152.76,
    "end_seconds": 155.15,
    "text": "obtain the non-linear map. Then both LS ROM and NM ROM substitutes these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.150",
    "end": "00:02:35.160",
    "start_seconds": 155.15,
    "end_seconds": 155.16,
    "text": "ROM and NM ROM substitutes these"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:35.160",
    "end": "00:02:37.190",
    "start_seconds": 155.16,
    "end_seconds": 157.19,
    "text": "ROM and NM ROM substitutes these solution representations into the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.190",
    "end": "00:02:37.200",
    "start_seconds": 157.19,
    "end_seconds": 157.2,
    "text": "solution representations into the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:37.200",
    "end": "00:02:39.430",
    "start_seconds": 157.2,
    "end_seconds": 159.43,
    "text": "solution representations into the governing equations. Since these are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.430",
    "end": "00:02:39.440",
    "start_seconds": 159.43,
    "end_seconds": 159.44,
    "text": "governing equations. Since these are"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.440",
    "end": "00:02:42.030",
    "start_seconds": 159.44,
    "end_seconds": 162.03,
    "text": "governing equations. Since these are overdetermined systems, we close them by"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.030",
    "end": "00:02:42.040",
    "start_seconds": 162.03,
    "end_seconds": 162.04,
    "text": "overdetermined systems, we close them by"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.040",
    "end": "00:02:44.710",
    "start_seconds": 162.04,
    "end_seconds": 164.71,
    "text": "overdetermined systems, we close them by minimizing the norm of the residuals. By"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.710",
    "end": "00:02:44.720",
    "start_seconds": 164.71,
    "end_seconds": 164.72,
    "text": "minimizing the norm of the residuals. By"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:44.720",
    "end": "00:02:48.070",
    "start_seconds": 164.72,
    "end_seconds": 168.07,
    "text": "minimizing the norm of the residuals. By the way, we have problems here. You see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.070",
    "end": "00:02:48.080",
    "start_seconds": 168.07,
    "end_seconds": 168.07999999999998,
    "text": "the way, we have problems here. You see"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.080",
    "end": "00:02:50.030",
    "start_seconds": 168.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 170.03,
    "text": "the way, we have problems here. You see these non-linear terms still scale with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.030",
    "end": "00:02:50.040",
    "start_seconds": 170.03,
    "end_seconds": 170.04,
    "text": "these non-linear terms still scale with"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:50.040",
    "end": "00:02:52.510",
    "start_seconds": 170.04,
    "end_seconds": 172.51,
    "text": "these non-linear terms still scale with the full order model size. This makes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.510",
    "end": "00:02:52.520",
    "start_seconds": 172.51,
    "end_seconds": 172.52,
    "text": "the full order model size. This makes"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:52.520",
    "end": "00:02:55.190",
    "start_seconds": 172.52,
    "end_seconds": 175.19,
    "text": "the full order model size. This makes the whole procedure more expensive than"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.190",
    "end": "00:02:55.200",
    "start_seconds": 175.19,
    "end_seconds": 175.2,
    "text": "the whole procedure more expensive than"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:55.200",
    "end": "00:02:57.150",
    "start_seconds": 175.2,
    "end_seconds": 177.15,
    "text": "the whole procedure more expensive than the corresponding full order models,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.150",
    "end": "00:02:57.160",
    "start_seconds": 177.15,
    "end_seconds": 177.16,
    "text": "the corresponding full order models,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.160",
    "end": "00:02:59.910",
    "start_seconds": 177.16,
    "end_seconds": 179.91,
    "text": "the corresponding full order models, which is completely useless. To resolve"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.910",
    "end": "00:02:59.920",
    "start_seconds": 179.91,
    "end_seconds": 179.92000000000002,
    "text": "which is completely useless. To resolve"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:59.920",
    "end": "00:03:02.030",
    "start_seconds": 179.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 182.03,
    "text": "which is completely useless. To resolve these serious problems, we developed a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.030",
    "end": "00:03:02.040",
    "start_seconds": 182.03,
    "end_seconds": 182.04,
    "text": "these serious problems, we developed a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.040",
    "end": "00:03:04.310",
    "start_seconds": 182.04,
    "end_seconds": 184.31,
    "text": "these serious problems, we developed a hyper reduction techniques."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.310",
    "end": "00:03:04.320",
    "start_seconds": 184.31,
    "end_seconds": 184.32,
    "text": "hyper reduction techniques."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.320",
    "end": "00:03:06.910",
    "start_seconds": 184.32,
    "end_seconds": 186.91,
    "text": "hyper reduction techniques. In hyper reduction, we try to reduce the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.910",
    "end": "00:03:06.920",
    "start_seconds": 186.91,
    "end_seconds": 186.92,
    "text": "In hyper reduction, we try to reduce the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:06.920",
    "end": "00:03:08.830",
    "start_seconds": 186.92,
    "end_seconds": 188.83,
    "text": "In hyper reduction, we try to reduce the cost of the following three non-linear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.830",
    "end": "00:03:08.840",
    "start_seconds": 188.83,
    "end_seconds": 188.84,
    "text": "cost of the following three non-linear"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:08.840",
    "end": "00:03:11.710",
    "start_seconds": 188.84,
    "end_seconds": 191.71,
    "text": "cost of the following three non-linear terms shown in red. Our hyper reduction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.710",
    "end": "00:03:11.720",
    "start_seconds": 191.71,
    "end_seconds": 191.72,
    "text": "terms shown in red. Our hyper reduction"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.720",
    "end": "00:03:13.830",
    "start_seconds": 191.72,
    "end_seconds": 193.83,
    "text": "terms shown in red. Our hyper reduction techniques first select a subset of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.830",
    "end": "00:03:13.840",
    "start_seconds": 193.83,
    "end_seconds": 193.84,
    "text": "techniques first select a subset of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.840",
    "end": "00:03:16.510",
    "start_seconds": 193.84,
    "end_seconds": 196.51,
    "text": "techniques first select a subset of non-linear terms to avoid the evaluation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.510",
    "end": "00:03:16.520",
    "start_seconds": 196.51,
    "end_seconds": 196.52,
    "text": "non-linear terms to avoid the evaluation"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:16.520",
    "end": "00:03:18.110",
    "start_seconds": 196.52,
    "end_seconds": 198.11,
    "text": "non-linear terms to avoid the evaluation of the full size."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.110",
    "end": "00:03:18.120",
    "start_seconds": 198.11,
    "end_seconds": 198.12,
    "text": "of the full size."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.120",
    "end": "00:03:20.110",
    "start_seconds": 198.12,
    "end_seconds": 200.11,
    "text": "of the full size. We do that by following gappy POD"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.110",
    "end": "00:03:20.120",
    "start_seconds": 200.11,
    "end_seconds": 200.12,
    "text": "We do that by following gappy POD"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.120",
    "end": "00:03:22.990",
    "start_seconds": 200.12,
    "end_seconds": 202.99,
    "text": "We do that by following gappy POD procedure. This implies that only subset"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:22.990",
    "end": "00:03:23.000",
    "start_seconds": 202.99,
    "end_seconds": 203.0,
    "text": "procedure. This implies that only subset"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.000",
    "end": "00:03:25.350",
    "start_seconds": 203.0,
    "end_seconds": 205.35,
    "text": "procedure. This implies that only subset of the neural network outputs need to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.350",
    "end": "00:03:25.360",
    "start_seconds": 205.35,
    "end_seconds": 205.36,
    "text": "of the neural network outputs need to be"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.360",
    "end": "00:03:28.070",
    "start_seconds": 205.36,
    "end_seconds": 208.07,
    "text": "of the neural network outputs need to be computed as illustrated with the orange"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.070",
    "end": "00:03:28.080",
    "start_seconds": 208.07,
    "end_seconds": 208.07999999999998,
    "text": "computed as illustrated with the orange"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.080",
    "end": "00:03:30.790",
    "start_seconds": 208.07999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 210.79,
    "text": "computed as illustrated with the orange discs in this decoder. Note that the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.790",
    "end": "00:03:30.800",
    "start_seconds": 210.79,
    "end_seconds": 210.8,
    "text": "discs in this decoder. Note that the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:30.800",
    "end": "00:03:32.790",
    "start_seconds": 210.8,
    "end_seconds": 212.79,
    "text": "discs in this decoder. Note that the shallower network involves the less"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.790",
    "end": "00:03:32.800",
    "start_seconds": 212.79,
    "end_seconds": 212.8,
    "text": "shallower network involves the less"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:32.800",
    "end": "00:03:34.790",
    "start_seconds": 212.8,
    "end_seconds": 214.79,
    "text": "shallower network involves the less number of hidden nodes for the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.790",
    "end": "00:03:34.800",
    "start_seconds": 214.79,
    "end_seconds": 214.8,
    "text": "number of hidden nodes for the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:34.800",
    "end": "00:03:37.430",
    "start_seconds": 214.8,
    "end_seconds": 217.43,
    "text": "number of hidden nodes for the computation of the selected outputs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.430",
    "end": "00:03:37.440",
    "start_seconds": 217.43,
    "end_seconds": 217.44,
    "text": "computation of the selected outputs."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.440",
    "end": "00:03:39.870",
    "start_seconds": 217.44,
    "end_seconds": 219.87,
    "text": "computation of the selected outputs. Furthermore, we build a sparser network"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.870",
    "end": "00:03:39.880",
    "start_seconds": 219.87,
    "end_seconds": 219.88,
    "text": "Furthermore, we build a sparser network"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.880",
    "end": "00:03:42.830",
    "start_seconds": 219.88,
    "end_seconds": 222.82999999999998,
    "text": "Furthermore, we build a sparser network by applying a mask to further increase"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.830",
    "end": "00:03:42.840",
    "start_seconds": 222.82999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 222.84,
    "text": "by applying a mask to further increase"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:42.840",
    "end": "00:03:44.550",
    "start_seconds": 222.84,
    "end_seconds": 224.55,
    "text": "by applying a mask to further increase the efficiency."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.550",
    "end": "00:03:44.560",
    "start_seconds": 224.55,
    "end_seconds": 224.56,
    "text": "the efficiency."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.560",
    "end": "00:03:46.390",
    "start_seconds": 224.56,
    "end_seconds": 226.39,
    "text": "the efficiency. Here we compare the performance of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.390",
    "end": "00:03:46.400",
    "start_seconds": 226.39,
    "end_seconds": 226.4,
    "text": "Here we compare the performance of"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.400",
    "end": "00:03:48.630",
    "start_seconds": 226.4,
    "end_seconds": 228.63,
    "text": "Here we compare the performance of various surrogate models in an advection"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.630",
    "end": "00:03:48.640",
    "start_seconds": 228.63,
    "end_seconds": 228.64,
    "text": "various surrogate models in an advection"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.640",
    "end": "00:03:51.910",
    "start_seconds": 228.64,
    "end_seconds": 231.91,
    "text": "various surrogate models in an advection dominated 2D viscous Burgers' equation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.910",
    "end": "00:03:51.920",
    "start_seconds": 231.91,
    "end_seconds": 231.92000000000002,
    "text": "dominated 2D viscous Burgers' equation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.920",
    "end": "00:03:54.950",
    "start_seconds": 231.92000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 234.95,
    "text": "dominated 2D viscous Burgers' equation, which is known to be a hard problem for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.950",
    "end": "00:03:54.960",
    "start_seconds": 234.95,
    "end_seconds": 234.96,
    "text": "which is known to be a hard problem for"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:54.960",
    "end": "00:03:57.830",
    "start_seconds": 234.96,
    "end_seconds": 237.82999999999998,
    "text": "which is known to be a hard problem for ROMs to achieve a good accuracy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.830",
    "end": "00:03:57.840",
    "start_seconds": 237.82999999999998,
    "end_seconds": 237.84,
    "text": "ROMs to achieve a good accuracy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.840",
    "end": "00:04:00.470",
    "start_seconds": 237.84,
    "end_seconds": 240.47,
    "text": "ROMs to achieve a good accuracy. As you can see from the movies, NM ROM"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.470",
    "end": "00:04:00.480",
    "start_seconds": 240.47,
    "end_seconds": 240.48,
    "text": "As you can see from the movies, NM ROM"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:00.480",
    "end": "00:04:02.830",
    "start_seconds": 240.48,
    "end_seconds": 242.83,
    "text": "As you can see from the movies, NM ROM and FOM are almost identical in eyeball"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.830",
    "end": "00:04:02.840",
    "start_seconds": 242.83,
    "end_seconds": 242.84,
    "text": "and FOM are almost identical in eyeball"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.840",
    "end": "00:04:06.190",
    "start_seconds": 242.84,
    "end_seconds": 246.19,
    "text": "and FOM are almost identical in eyeball norms, while LS ROM shows fictitious"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.190",
    "end": "00:04:06.200",
    "start_seconds": 246.19,
    "end_seconds": 246.2,
    "text": "norms, while LS ROM shows fictitious"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.200",
    "end": "00:04:09.190",
    "start_seconds": 246.2,
    "end_seconds": 249.19,
    "text": "norms, while LS ROM shows fictitious oscillations in front of the shock wave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.190",
    "end": "00:04:09.200",
    "start_seconds": 249.19,
    "end_seconds": 249.2,
    "text": "oscillations in front of the shock wave."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.200",
    "end": "00:04:11.910",
    "start_seconds": 249.2,
    "end_seconds": 251.91,
    "text": "oscillations in front of the shock wave. The BB approach looks okay in eyeball"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.910",
    "end": "00:04:11.920",
    "start_seconds": 251.91,
    "end_seconds": 251.92,
    "text": "The BB approach looks okay in eyeball"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:11.920",
    "end": "00:04:15.270",
    "start_seconds": 251.92,
    "end_seconds": 255.27,
    "text": "The BB approach looks okay in eyeball norm. However, quantitatively, the BB"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.270",
    "end": "00:04:15.280",
    "start_seconds": 255.27,
    "end_seconds": 255.28,
    "text": "norm. However, quantitatively, the BB"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.280",
    "end": "00:04:18.190",
    "start_seconds": 255.28,
    "end_seconds": 258.19,
    "text": "norm. However, quantitatively, the BB approach has the worst maximum relative"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.190",
    "end": "00:04:18.200",
    "start_seconds": 258.19,
    "end_seconds": 258.2,
    "text": "approach has the worst maximum relative"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.200",
    "end": "00:04:21.190",
    "start_seconds": 258.2,
    "end_seconds": 261.19,
    "text": "approach has the worst maximum relative error, that is around 38%."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:21.190",
    "end": "00:04:21.200",
    "start_seconds": 261.19,
    "end_seconds": 261.2,
    "text": "error, that is around 38%."
  },
